 "intro_html": "The bowl: big shrimp, <b>cut in half crosswise</b> into two shorter pieces, seared in a hot pan and glazed with a splash of soy sauce. Mix them with finely chopped store-bought pickled ginger and spicy mayo until the whole thing is one even, cool <b>pink-coral</b>. Spoon it over <a href=\"sushi-rice.html\">sushi rice</a>, then a spoon of cold <b>ikura</b> in the center.",
