  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Stir together in the mixing bowl:<ul class=\"ing\"><li>japanese mayo (kewpie) <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"4\">4 tbsp</span></span></li><li>sriracha <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"1\">1 tbsp</span></span></li></ul></li><li>It should be a pale pink-coral. Taste; add a little more sriracha if you want it hotter. Use a bowl big enough to mix the shrimp in later.</li></ul>",
