     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"count\" data-a=\"2\" data-f=\"bowl|bowls\" data-n=\"1\">2 bowls</span>",
     "name_html": "Sushi rice"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Lay a shrimp flat on the board in its natural curl.</li><li>Hold it with your fingertips curled under and cut straight <b>across the middle</b>, through the thickest part of the curl, into <b>two shorter pieces</b> — a thick head-end piece and a tail-end piece of about the same size.</li><li>Repeat with the rest, then pat the pieces very dry with paper towels — dry pieces sear instead of steaming.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-3",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Cut the shrimp in half crosswise",
    "diagram": null,
    "how": [
