     "name_html": "Large raw shrimp, peeled and deveined, tails off"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Heat the oil in the frying pan over <b>medium-high</b> heat until it shimmers.</li><li>Lay the pieces flat in one layer. Sear about 1 minute, until the underside turns pink with a little golden colour.</li><li>Flip and cook about 1 minute more, until pink and opaque all the way through. Don’t crowd the pan — two batches if needed.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
